<p>A <code>ganttTableTfoot</code> is one part of a
  <a href="/components/gantt-table/"><code>ganttTable</code></a>.
  It maps to the native HTML <code>&lt;tfoot&gt;</code>
  element. See the <a href="/components/gantt-table/">Gantt Table
  demo</a> for composed examples.</p>

{# BEGIN generated: examples (bin/generate-examples) #}
<h2>Usage</h2>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>{% raw %}&lt;GanttTable label="Q1 2025 schedule"&gt;
  &lt;GanttTableHead&gt;...&lt;/GanttTableHead&gt;
  &lt;GanttTableBody&gt;...&lt;/GanttTableBody&gt;
  &lt;GanttTableTfoot&gt;
    &lt;GanttTableRow&gt;
      &lt;GanttTableTH scope="row"&gt;Milestone&lt;/GanttTableTH&gt;
      &lt;GanttTableTD&gt;&lt;/GanttTableTD&gt;
      &lt;GanttTableTD&gt;&lt;/GanttTableTD&gt;
      &lt;GanttTableTD&gt;Launch&lt;/GanttTableTD&gt;
    &lt;/GanttTableRow&gt;
  &lt;/GanttTableTfoot&gt;
&lt;/GanttTable&gt;
{% endraw %}</code></pre>
